description: PostgreSQL through Drizzle ORM and postgres.js — schema in src/db/schema, committed SQL migrations from drizzle-kit, repositories that accept a DbExecutor, transactions owned by services, keyset pagination.
globs: ["**/src/db/**/*.ts", "**/src/repositories/**/*.ts", "**/drizzle.config.ts", "**/drizzle/**/*.sql"]
alwaysApply: false
